      "LearningObjectiveAr": "استخدام هوية فيثاغورس لإيجاد جيب التمام",
      "LearningObjectiveEn": "Use the Pythagorean identity to find cosine",
      "QuestionTextAr": "إذا كانت θ زاوية حادة وsin(θ) = 3/5، فما cos(θ)؟",
      "QuestionTextEn": "If θ is an acute angle and sin(θ) = 3/5, what is cos(θ)?",
      "DetailedSolutionAr": "من sin²(θ) + cos²(θ) = 1 نحصل على cos²(θ) = 1 − 9/25 = 16/25. نأخذ الجذر الموجب لأن θ حادة: cos(θ) = 4/5.",
      "DetailedSolutionEn": "Since sin² θ + cos² θ = 1, cos² θ = 1 − 9/25 = 16/25. The angle is acute, so cos θ = 4/5.",
      "Options": [
        {
          "Order": 1,
          "LatexCode": "\\frac35",
          "IsCorrect": false
        },
        {
          "Order": 2,
          "LatexCode": "\\frac45",
          "IsCorrect": true
        },
        {
          "Order": 3,
          "LatexCode": "\\frac{16}{25}",
          "IsCorrect": false
        },
        {
          "Order": 4,
          "LatexCode": "-\\frac45",
          "IsCorrect": false
        }
      ],
      "DifficultyLevel": 2,
      "PisaProcess": "employ",
      "CognitiveType": "positive-root",
      "Points": 10,
      "ExpertReview": "pending"
    },
